A moonlit winter night falling into snow: deep navy on the F-row, moonlight
blue, icy powder, then snow white on the bottom rows, with a slow snowfall
twinkle drifting over random keys. Escape is the pale moon, the nav cluster is
the warm hearth, arrows are the golden cabin window, and every keypress flares
snow-white.
"""

